			"locked": false,
			"customData": {
				"generatedSlide": 3
			},
			"text": "If not every correct peer delivers, the peers stop at the deadline, send DONE, and wait for STOP.\nZeroMQ adds RELEASE at the end of a test: a peer may only start the next test after it.",
			"originalText": "If not every correct peer delivers, the peers stop at the deadline, send DONE, and wait for STOP.\nZeroMQ adds RELEASE at the end of a test: a peer may only start the next test after it.",
